# anime.js scroll motor

Use when implementing or changing scroll-driven motion.

- Scroll progress is the clock; anime.js owns path, timing, and triggers.
- Cheese-mouse walk and crumb emission are motor concerns (anime.js), not Canvas UI.
- Keep motion state readable (progress 0→1 → pose). Avoid fighting React re-renders with ad-hoc timers when scroll sync exists.
- Homage logo only; do not ship Cheese Studio brand assets as if official.
- Point writers at existing motion modules in-repo once they exist rather than re-copying patterns into prompts.
